    <Placemark>
      <name>Yuko Shiraishi: Brief Encounter - Gazebo</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Yuko Shiraishi: Brief Encounter - Gazebo</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 30th Apr – Sat 18th Jul<br>Annely Juda Fine Art, London<br>Check site<br><br>“for this project - another in my Imaginary Architecture series - I chose to explore iridescent clouds, sometimes known as \&quot;rainbow clouds\&quot;, a meteorological phenomenon characterised by vibrant, colourful bands appearing on thin, semi-transparent clouds<br><br><a href="https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/yuko-shiraishi-brief-encounter-gazebo/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
