    <Placemark>
      <name>Richard Kenton Webb: Passion Drawings</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Richard Kenton Webb: Passion Drawings</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 30th Apr – Sat 11th Jul<br>Benjamin Rhodes Arts, London<br>Check site<br><br>“a book / exhibition of 24 drawings about love … an intensely sensitive suite of drawings inspired by the Passion of Christ and dedicated to all outsiders”<br><br><a href="https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/richard-kenton-webb-passion-drawings-english-iconoclasm/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
