      <name>John Riddy: Winter Landscape</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>John Riddy: Winter Landscape</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 30th Apr – Thu 25th Jun<br>Frith Street Gallery, London<br>Check site<br><br>new photographs of London by Riddy - “both a description of place and a kind of social survey”<br><br><a href="https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/john-riddy-winter-landscape/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
