      <name>Olive Oil Bar</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Olive Oil Bar</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Wed 3rd Jun – Mon 29th Jun<br>Seven Dials, Monmouth Street, Covent Garden, Covent Garden<br>Free<br><br>Olive Oil Bar back to the capital. Popping up in Covent Garden this June, the Olive Oil Bar is a one-stop-shop for all things EVOO. Designed as a place to discover and taste extra virgin olive oils, the bar will host free daily tastings, with a bunch of special events also on the programme. Founder Sarah Vachon (one of<br><br><a href="https://londontheinside.com/map/pop-ups/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
