      <name>Patricia Piccinini: Holding Tight and Letting Go</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Patricia Piccinini: Holding Tight and Letting Go</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 4th Jun – Sat 11th Jul<br>Ames Yavuz, London West End<br>Check site<br><br>Piccinini’s first presentation with the gallery in London explores kinship through humanoid chimeras in silicone and fibreglass, reflecting empathy, “speculative optimism”, and the tension between cruelty and tenderness<br><br><a href="https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/patricia-piccinini-holding-tight-and-letting-go/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
