      <name>Colour is the Place</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Colour is the Place</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 4th Jun – Sat 18th Jul<br>Dirimart London, London West End<br>Check site<br><br>curated by Jessica Cerasi, works by “four painters for whom the canvas operates as a site of reflection … where colour is not decoration or description; it is a primary language, capable of saying what words can only attempt to approach&quot;<br><br><a href="https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/group-exhibition-40/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
